{"speciesId":689,"names":{"fr":"Golgopathe","es":"Barbaracle","en":"Barbaracle","ja":"ガメノデス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Après évolution, les deux Opermine laissent place à sept créatures qui ont la puissance cumulée de sept Opermine."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Al evolucionar, los dos Binacle se dividen y dan lugar a siete criaturas que se aglomeran formando un Barbaracle y suman su poder al combatir."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When they evolve, two Binacle multiply into seven. They fight with the power of seven Binacle."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"進化のとき ２匹の カメテテが ７匹に 分裂した ポケモン。 ７匹分の パワーで 戦う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses jambes et ses bras sont dotés d’une volonté propre. Cependant, ils suivent généralement les ordres donnés."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Si bien todas las extremidades de Barbaracle tienen cerebro propio y se mueven a su antojo, suelen seguir las órdenes que imparte la cabeza."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Barbaracle’s legs and hands have minds of their own, and they will move independently. But they usually follow the head’s orders."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"手足にも 脳が あり 勝手に 動けるが 普段は 頭の ガメノデスの 命令に 従う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Après évolution, les deux Opermine laissent place à sept créatures qui ont la puissance cumulée de sept Opermine."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Al evolucionar, los dos Binacle se dividen y dan lugar a siete criaturas que se aglomeran formando un Barbaracle y suman su poder al combatir."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"When they evolve, two Binacle multiply into seven. They fight with the power of seven Binacle."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"進化のとき ２匹の カメテテが ７匹に 分裂した ポケモン。 ７匹分の パワーで 戦う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ses jambes et ses bras sont dotés d’une volonté propre. Cependant, ils suivent généralement 